Step 0: Input Datasets 

crma_hive.crma_hive_fismascorecard_input_devices: Device inventory for FISMA Scorecard (primarily from Axonius). 

 

 

Step 1: Select Eligible Devices 

Purpose: Identify devices relevant for component-level HWAM scoring. 

